      "items": [
        {
          "q": "Which systems can we connect?",
          "a": "Bitrix24, 1C, documents in PDF, Word and Excel, Google Drive, Confluence, email, Telegram and OpenCart. Other systems and AI agents connect through the API."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do we need a developer to set it up?",
          "a": "No. Systems connect through ready-made connectors, and during the pilot we help you set everything up."
        },
        {
          "q": "How does the data stay up to date?",
          "a": "Automatically. When prices and stock change in 1C, deals in Bitrix24 or your documents, WikiAI picks up the changes on its own."
        },
        {
          "q": "What if WikiAI gets an answer wrong?",
          "a": "WikiAI answers only from your data and shows the source of every answer, so it's easy to check. If there's no reliable answer, WikiAI says so."
        },
        {
          "q": "Where is our data stored, and who can see it?",
          "a": "Each company's data is stored separately, in our cloud or on your own servers. Only your staff can see it, with role-based access."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can we connect our phone system?",
          "a": "Yes. WikiAI connects to your PBX over SIP: it answers customers by voice and prompts your team during calls. Your numbers and call routing stay the same."
        }
      ]
